    "body": "The function is only present in version > 1.7.0\r\nAt this point this is not yet on PyPi, you can upgrade by installing tequila from devel branch\r\neither:\r\n```bash\r\npip install --upgrade git+https://github.com/aspuru-guzik-group/tequila.git@devel\r\n```\r\nor in dev mode\r\n```bash\r\ngit clone https://github.com/tequilahub/tequila.git \r\ncd tequila\r\ngit checkout devel\r\ngit pull origin devel\r\npip install -e .\r\n```\r\n\r\n",
